@startuml deployment
!include ../style.iuml
title CTC Office — Deployment

node "Host PC\nWindows 11, one machine, no network" as PC {
  artifact "TrackOverflow.exe\n(PyInstaller bundle)" as Exe
  node "Central harness process" as HP {
    component "Central Harness\nshared clock, edge mappings,\nroster, event log (CSV)" as Harness
  }
  node "CTC Office process\n(executable in module mode: ctc-office)" as CP {
    component "CTC Office window\n(PySide6 / QML)" as Win
    component "CtcHost + StubCtcOffice\n(Green and Red Lines)" as Core
    component "CtcOfficeProcess\n+ ModuleLink" as Proc
  }
  node "Other module processes" as Others {
    component "Track Ctrl SW (Green)" as TCSW
    component "Track Ctrl HW host (Red)" as TCHW
    component "Track Model" as TM
    component "Train Model" as TrM
    component "Train Ctrl SW / HW host" as TrC
  }
  folder "Data (bundled)" as Data {
    file "TrackModel/green_line.json\nTrackModel/red_line.json\ntrack layout" as Layout
    file "utils/schedule_v4.json\nschedule (any file in that format)" as Sched
  }
}

Exe ..> HP : starts
HP --> CP : spawns
HP --> Others : spawns
Harness <--> Proc : local socket (named pipe)\nnewline JSON: READY, STEP,\nSTATE, QUIT (D005)
Harness <--> Others : newline JSON
Proc --> Core
Win --> Core
Core ..> Layout : read at start
Win ..> Sched : Load schedule

note bottom of PC
  The CTC Office runs on the host only: no hardware variant.
  Closing its window hides it; only the harness ends the process.
  The CTC test UI (ctc_ui/test_ui.py) is a debugging tool: it is
  not packaged and the harness never starts it (D005, D025).
end note
@enduml
